{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is It ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jrpg with turnbased combat using a mix of 2D Pixel and 3D.\u00a0 A story arc that stretch far beyond what you may expect from a solodeveloped Jrpg project. This is my first , only and last game i will ever create and i'm pouring my heart and soul for the brave few into having the characters and story to be something you will remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plot twists , curve balls, politics, religion, love , hate , sorrow,\u00a0 a mature adventure that sometimes is unfair and\u00a0</i>you will either love or hate the characters in Seed of God but always have a desire to push on and explore  and experience  the journey together with the main cast\u00a0 in the kingdom of Riebenhelm in a  tragic but hopeful saga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put yourself into detective mode for this game will not hold your hand , if you solve a secret or mystery you will be rewarded with a feel that you accomplished using your own reasoning skills for game will not tell you with flashing map markers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/accabdc44cc8707d33f099835f67fdd2.avif?t=1756653443\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avelon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant world surrounded by a endless Sea and shrouded in mist, protected by God and the Pillar of light Avelons inhabitants pray everyday to keep it so. <br>With fear everyone remember what happend a millennia ago.\u00a0 Whispers of a crazy king in the east may once again put avelon in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/6522ffe17713e39a72a11e93d2225fd5.avif?t=1756653443\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several towns with completely different character and architecture with stores, libraries, taverns and more plus one of two secrets awaits to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to people to uncover sotries or initiate quests that will or will not reward you. Dive into the books at the library to understand the world or find solutions to mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the worldmap and explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/dcc19b7ac3bfb20b6e5b409f096cc114.avif?t=1756653443\" width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/c24a78778c1ea17391308977142a7f1e.avif?t=1756653443\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good or Bad and even Romance ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will constantly be faced with morale dilemmas or choices that define who you are or how events unfold and can even affect relationship with characters in Kingdom of Riebenhelm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But caution ! often you only have one chance to make a decision and there is no easy way of knowing what was affected.<br>You may but mostly not know beforehand how or when your choiceds will affect the gameplay so be prepared to live with the consequence of your choice.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/f707652860a31c818276e7a56ac8f75f.avif?t=1756653443\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Chards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use token earned through quests and combat to unlock new skills and magic\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/eb2c5d006354441397045375d022a292.avif?t=1756653443\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turnbased Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With several partymembers you combat both random encounters and visible threats using weapons , skills , items and magic and your partymembers<br>brings their own unique weapons and skills to aid you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience points to level up your stats and beat even greaters foes all who are\u00a0 \u00a0 created unique for this game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/e306b8cbf1d1f98b0c2497ece5220bb2.avif?t=1756653443\" data-has-big width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/2990caf9fef2431c3af727fbc811ef26.avif?t=1756653443\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Influences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I grew up in the golden era of JRPG and Finalfantasy 7&amp;9\u00a0 influenced greatly how arcs and story is told in Seed of God.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is best described as a darker and more mature version of Finalfantasy but retain the same storybeats and type of gameplay with larger than life story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Main Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story is aimed at a mature audience with little or none creative restrictions so expect the unexpected at any given time as you travel. It is a tale of great tragedy but with a seed of hope and alot of humor. <br>It will take you through several towns and uniqe locations throughout your adventure and  <br>characters  you meet will be given plenty of space to tell their story for you to dive into the lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game description and trailers are kept spoiler free to not give away suprises. Expect a journey of EPIC proportions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/a4312936e20710951bb432366dc48a69.avif?t=1756653443\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support , be part of the game or or give me the solo developer some motivation please visit the games discord .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful kickstarter campaign : Thank you for supporting me !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147730?t=1756653443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756653443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/970ac7296dc6d7ddf3c92f68ea4950e72f6c7b1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756653443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/970ac7296dc6d7ddf3c92f68ea4950e72f6c7b1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756653443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2