eplay with larger than life story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Main Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story is aimed at a mature audience with little or none creative restrictions so expect the unexpected at any given time as you travel. It is a tale of great tragedy but with a seed of hope and alot of humor. <br>It will take you through several towns and uniqe locations throughout your adventure and  <br>characters  you meet will be given plenty of space to tell their story for you to dive into the lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game description and trailers are kept spoiler free to not give away suprises. Expect a journey of EPIC proportions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/extras/a4312936e20710951bb432366dc48a69.avif?t=1756653443\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support , be part of the game or or give me the solo developer some motivation please visit the games discord .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful kickstarter campaign : Thank you for supporting me !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["One guy no gang production"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147730/705c1492d2a2d1148d5355761d2f8f8b2b1611c4/header.jpg?t=1756653443","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147730/811322/09bd228fe8798e5ccf537326265e0825816e1d15/1750875050/dash_av1.mpd?t=1736666836","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147